{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこで変顔載せられてたよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せていいよなんて許可してないけど\nねねだからゆるすの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤ちゃんずだからいいの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ははは\nあの写真懐かしいなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は雨だったねー寒かった。\n明日は晴れみたいだから、よかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私は今日金沢ガールズ\nフェスのリハが終わったあと\nみさ先輩とカフェに行ったんだよ。\n先輩はチーズラーらしいよ！\n私もチーズすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬服と夏服、どっちが好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間をとって春服です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで、ブログの絵文字\n面白いのが多いの？←"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきなデコメしか使ってない笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花見行ったのー＼(^o^)／？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行ってないよー\nバスの中で眺めてた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はまってる\nテレビ番組教えてください♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京カワイイTVずっと見てたけど\n終わってしまったの泣\n月曜から夜ふかしも見てるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のどこが好きー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眉毛と髪の色\n趣味が女の子なとこかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラッグストアのおばちゃんに\n何褒められたの？(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芸能人さんみたいね～\nかわいらしいね～\nて言われたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかの前髪、\n私好きなんですけど、\nどうやってセットしてるんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストレートアイロンで\n軽くくるんとするだけだよー\n前髪まで好いてくれて私は嬉しいよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪って自分では切らないで\n美容院でやってもらうの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアメイクさんにお願いする！\n時間なかったら自分で切る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤ちゃんず単推しってどう？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近伊藤ちゃんずを知ってくれる\n人が増えてきて嬉しい！\nそりゃ喜ぶよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかの座右の銘はなんぞや??\n答えてちょ!!!!!!!!!ww"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自然体‼!!!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボブの写真の感想ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合ってる似合ってないは\nまあそれぞれ...\nウィッグとか気が向いたら\n付けてみようかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかしほとんどが騙されてたな！\nひゃははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この襟付きトップス\n男性受けがいいのね。\n服いいね！ってコメント多かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近CHILDWOMANで買ったよ！\nかわいくて万能なの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/25/1290725/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}